```python
pem = key.private_bytes(encoding=Encoding.PEM, format=PrivateFormat.TraditionalOpenSSL, encryption_algorithm=BestAvailableCipher(secrets.token_hex(16)))
```
This encrypts the private key with a randomly generated password each time.
